563
01:26:30.578 --> 01:26:31.578
Nothing.

564
01:26:31.578 --> 01:26:37.578
If you think that, if you think you can balance on a border, then you are mistaken.

565
01:26:39.578 --> 01:26:40.578
There is literally nothing.

