01:29:36.578 --> 01:29:40.578
And the advice of the world is to follow what makes you happiest.

613
01:29:41.578 --> 01:29:47.578
I just want to make it clear that the kingdom of God is different from the world.

614
01:29:49.578 --> 01:29:51.578
