647
01:32:10.578 --> 01:32:12.578
And that is the reason why we do this.

648
01:32:13.578 --> 01:32:15.578
And that is the reason why we do this.

649
01:32:16.578 --> 01:32:19.578
Jesus wants us to take the lowest place.

650
01:32:20.578 --> 01:32:21.578
We serve each other.

651
01:32:22.578 --> 01:32:25.578
The world says, of course, make yourself known and let yourself be served.

652
01:32:27.578 --> 01:32:30.578
Some things are very confronting, but that does not make them less valuable.

653
01:32:32.578 --> 01:32:34.578
They are therefore not less true, sorry.

654
